Third-party data — Center for Global Development is not the licensor
=====================================================================

Three raw source files are committed in this directory. They are the work of
other organisations, redistributed here unchanged because they cannot be
fetched by script. The MIT licence at the root of this repository does not
apply to them, and neither CGD nor this repository grants any rights in them.

Each is licensed by its publisher under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0), which permits redistribution, including
commercially, with attribution:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  CW_HistoricalEmissions_ClimateWatch.csv
      Climate Watch Historical GHG Emissions, World Resources Institute.
      1990-2023 release, downloaded 20 April 2026.
      https://www.climatewatchdata.org/ghg-emissions

  National_Fossil_Carbon_Emissions_2025_v0.3.xlsx
      Global Carbon Project, Global Carbon Budget 2025, national fossil
      emissions, v0.3. Downloaded 19 February 2026.
      https://www.icos-cp.eu/impact/science/global-carbon-budget/2025

  National_LandUseChange_Carbon_Emissions_2025v0.2.xlsx
      Global Carbon Project, Global Carbon Budget 2025, national land-use
      change emissions, v0.2. Downloaded 19 February 2026.
      https://www.icos-cp.eu/impact/science/global-carbon-budget/2025

The remaining sources used by this analysis are not committed here. Their
licences, versions and download links are recorded in README.md in this
directory. Two are worth noting: PRIMAP-hist is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
(non-commercial, share-alike), and the Carbon Brief territorial rule database
states no licence at all. Both are linked rather than redistributed.
